{"id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-ultrafilter.md","title":"Ultrafilter","display":"df-ultrafilter — Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-ultrafilter","aliases":["57-df-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-ultrafilter — Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[57-df-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrafilter — Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" href=\"?note=d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" title=\"57-df-filter\">57-df-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为候选子集族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" href=\"?note=d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" title=\"57-df-filter\">57-df-filter</a>，它包含非平凡滤条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq I\\;\n(X\\in\\mathcal U\\lor I\\setminus X\\in\\mathcal U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq I\\;\n(X\\in\\mathcal U\\lor I\\setminus X\\in\\mathcal U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFilt}(I)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I):\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UltraFilt}(I)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I):\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非平凡性保证互补两侧不会同时属于 U；无需另把未声明的 Filter 二元谓词当作已定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I$ 为集合，$\\mathcal U$ 为候选子集族。$\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)$ 见 [[57-df-filter]]，它包含非平凡滤条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Filter}(\\mathcal U,I)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq I\\;\n(X\\in\\mathcal U\\lor I\\setminus X\\in\\mathcal U).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFilt}(I)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I):\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":786,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbcf27e4396f5d65","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\ne\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$ 见 [[57-df-ultrafilter]]；$X=\\prod_{i\\in I}A_i$ 见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]；$f,g\\in X$。"},{"id":"f71aeba7a1e4b877","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A$ 为常值结构族，超积与等价类记号见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]，积见 [[57-df-indexed-product]]。$a\\in A$；$c_a:I\\to A$ 是常值函数，$d$ 是对角函数。"},{"id":"ba7cca711eed5e6b","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景 ZFC；$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，见 [[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i$ 是固定同签名 $S$ 的非空结构族，见 [[57-df-family]]、[[57-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"bbf3699dee0bf4ca","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\equiv$ 为初等等价；$\\mathrm{UltraFilt}(I)$ 取 [[57-df-ultrafilter]]，超幂及同构取 [[57-df-ultrapower]]、[[57-df-isomorphism]]。量词 $I$ 遍历非空集合，背景集合论为 ZFC。"},{"id":"c01dc45d7752c583","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景 ZFC。$I\\neq\\emptyset$，$\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$，$i\\mapsto\\mathfrak A_i$ 为同签名结构族；全部解释见 [[57-df-ultraproduct]]、[[57-df-ultrafilter]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，其自由变量依固定次序恰为 $x_1,\\ldots,x_n$，$n\\geq0$，见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。$f_j\\in\\prod_i|\\mathfrak A_i|$，$[f_j]=[f_j]_{\\mathcal U}$；参数列满足记号见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"44dd658f048c8786","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I \\neq \\varnothing$ (非空指标集, see [[57-df-ultrafilter]])"},{"id":"b3c8f915815b84c2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-a